1
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:44,399
Brother Qiang!

2
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:46,840
No, don't, Brother Qiang!

3
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,880
Please, don't, Brother Qiang!

4
00:00:55,039 --> 00:00:56,119
Hey, A Qiang!

5
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,439
Where are you?

6
00:00:57,759 --> 00:00:59,320
The pork plant on the outskirts.

7
00:00:59,439 --> 00:00:59,840
Hello?

8
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:00,479
Call an ambulance!

9
00:01:00,479 --> 00:01:00,920
Hello?

10
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,079
Where's Xie Guanhong?

11
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:21,040
I'm asking you.

12
00:01:21,959 --> 00:01:23,640
Where is Xie Guanhong?

13
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:26,480
I don't know.

14
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:32,359
Tell me.

15
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,319
Where is he?

16
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,480
I really don't know.

17
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:43,159
32 Haining Road.

18
00:01:44,319 --> 00:01:45,719
That's his mistress's factory.

19
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,640
You can go check there.

20
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,640
A Qiang.

21
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,879
I know saying all this now

22
00:01:55,879 --> 00:01:57,280
probably means nothing.

23
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:01,280
But if I don't say it,

24
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:03,719
I might never get the chance again.

25
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,759
All these years,

26
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:15,599
I've always thought of you.

27
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,639
No matter what I went through,

28
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:20,159
just thinking that

29
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,280
you were still alive out there,

30
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,800
that one day you'd come back,

31
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,919
made me feel I could hold on.

32
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:33,879
I know it's probably too late to say this,

33
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:35,680
but...

34
00:02:42,719 --> 00:02:43,560
I'm sorry.

35
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,560
I'm sorry.

36
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:50,680
You don't need to apologize to me.

37
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,919
You didn't wrong me.

38
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,960
We're the ones who wronged Danni.

39
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,560
She was never part of this world.

40
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,960
Because of me,

41
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,520
because of you,

42
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,159
because of Xie Guanhong,

43
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,719
she got dragged into it.

44
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:13,439
We sent her to her death with our own hands.

45
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,360
That bitch named Danni...

46
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:30,879
Couldn't take it and jumped, what a buzzkill.

47
00:03:31,479 --> 00:03:32,159
Hit this one.

48
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:32,719
Got it.

49
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:33,879
Brother Xia.

50
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,000
When you grabbed her,

51
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,639
didn't you have a little fun?

52
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:42,080
You think I wouldn't have some fun?

53
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:45,080
That bitch had a pretty face, though,

54
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:47,840
but her body was scrawny, just like yours.

55
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,719
No fun at all.

56
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,680
I hear you've got a hot little cousin.

57
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,520
Hook me up so I can blow off some steam.

58
00:03:53,639 --> 00:03:55,879
I'm gonna post this.

59
00:04:11,879 --> 00:04:12,840
Brother Qiang!

60
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,680
You've got some nerve.

61
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,000
Coming here all by yourself.

62
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,120
Where's Xie Guanhong?

63
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,439
Liang Zhiqiang.

64
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,800
You still think you're the big boss now?

65
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:29,399
Think you can just see Brother Hong?

66
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,959
Wise up and get the hell out!

67
00:04:32,319 --> 00:04:35,000
Or don't blame us for disrespecting you,

68
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,079
and sending you to join that bitch Danni.

69
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:42,240
You hear me?

70
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,279
The boss told you to scram.

71
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:44,720
Scram!

72
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:48,879
What the hell?

73
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:14,600
What are you spacing out for? Cut him!

74
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,839
Get him!

75
00:06:05,519 --> 00:06:06,240
Hit him!

76
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:18,720
Take it easy.

77
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,079
It's a call from Officer Chen.

78
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,120
A Qiang.

79
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,120
It's Chen Jiadong.

80
00:07:38,399 --> 00:07:39,800
I won't waste words with you.

81
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:41,680
I know you have the USB drive.

82
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:43,199
A Fei, you can trust her.

83
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,000
She's one of my people.

84
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,879
Three in the afternoon.

85
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,879
Three in the afternoon.

86
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,560
Central Pier.

87
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,560
You can't go.

88
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,040
Arresting Xie Guanhong

89
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:31,120
is the police's job.

90
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,639
You can't do this anymore.

91
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:36,159
I've already given you the evidence.

92
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,279
I want you to move fast

93
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:41,159
and tear Heyisheng out by the roots.

94
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:45,080
As for Xie Guanhong, that's my business.

95
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,200
I'll handle him myself.

96
00:09:00,559 --> 00:09:01,360
Officer Chen.

97
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,320
The evidence checks out.

98
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,360
We've got the lead.

99
00:09:06,759 --> 00:09:07,840
We can finally close the net.

100
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,639
Brother Wah got a tip-off.

101
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,080
They're armed with heavy weapons.

102
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:14,600
Everyone, listen up.

103
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,360
We're switching to plan two.

104
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,480
Advance every front line.

105
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,639
Seal off all the streets.

106
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,879
On my command, everyone get ready.

107
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:24,279
The second Portland Street operation.

108
00:09:24,919 --> 00:09:25,600
Go!

109
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:27,600
Yes, sir!

110
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:46,559
Uncle Fat is already gone.

111
00:09:48,039 --> 00:09:49,919
We can't wait any longer.

112
00:09:51,919 --> 00:09:55,559
This bastard has lost his mind.

113
00:09:56,759 --> 00:09:58,840
He even kills his own people.

114
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:02,960
The cops are hitting us hard this time.

115
00:10:03,279 --> 00:10:05,039
We can't even go back to the company.

116
00:10:08,519 --> 00:10:09,720
How many years has it been

117
00:10:09,919 --> 00:10:10,759
since we last came here

118
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:12,600
to hold a meeting at Kowloon Cafe?

119
00:10:14,159 --> 00:10:15,919
The way Xie Guanhong's acting,

120
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,480
he wants all of Heyisheng

121
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,720
to go down with him.

122
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,000
We can't keep putting up with this.

123
00:10:22,159 --> 00:10:23,960
Or none of us will know who's next to die.

124
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,759
Us old-timers now,

125
00:10:25,759 --> 00:10:27,039
we can't keep him in check anymore.

126
00:10:27,799 --> 00:10:29,559
Guanhong isn't crazy.

127
00:10:29,559 --> 00:10:31,559
He knows the times have changed.

128
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,960
All the old rules are broken.

129
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:38,600
The times really have changed.

130
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,759
Changed, my ass.

131
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:42,159
Some things never change.

132
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:44,919
What's there to be afraid of?

133
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:48,039
We've got people up top covering us.

134
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:50,360
We always pull through in the end.

135
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:54,240
We don't even know who's covering us.

136
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,200
Once Guanhong goes down,

137
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,080
who's gonna look after us?

138
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,480
I can't even see clearly anymore.

139
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,360
Should've retired long ago.

140
00:11:05,879 --> 00:11:07,759
The times are changing too fast.

141
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:10,919
Is there still a place for us in Gangcheng?

142
00:11:12,159 --> 00:11:15,519
The people behind us just want money.

143
00:11:16,879 --> 00:11:18,320
Not Xie Guanhong himself.

144
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,000
Anyone else would be just the same.

145
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:22,120
It's not that Gangcheng has no room for us.

146
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:24,000
It's that we lost our own nerve.

147
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,320
Who?
